  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(2-a) 矩阵A的固有值和对角化判定",
      "steps": [
        "计算特征多项式：",
        "$$\\det(A - \\lambda I) = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} 1-\\lambda & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix}$$",
        "$$= (1-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda) + 1 = \\lambda^2 - 4\\lambda + 4 = (\\lambda - 2)^2$$",
        "特征方程：$(\\lambda - 2)^2 = 0$，得 $\\lambda = 2$（二重根，代数重数为2）",
        "求固有向量：解 $(A - 2I)\\mathbf{v} = \\mathbf{0}$，即",
        "$$\\begin{pmatrix} -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix} v_1 \\\\ v_2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}$$",
        "得 $v_1 + v_2 = 0$，固有向量空间为 $\\text{span}\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ -1 \\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}$",
        "几何重数为1（特征子空间维数为1）",
        "因为代数重数（2）$\\ne$ 几何重数（1），所以 $A$ **不可对角化**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2-b) 矩阵B的固有值和对角化判定",
      "steps": [
        "计算特征多项式：",
        "$$\\det(B - \\lambda I) = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} -1-\\lambda & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2-\\lambda & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -1-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix}$$",
        "按第一行展开：",
        "$$= (-1-\\lambda)\\det\\begin{pmatrix} 2-\\lambda & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} + 2\\det\\begin{pmatrix} -2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} + 1\\det\\begin{pmatrix} -2 & 2-\\lambda \\\\ 1 & -2 \\end{pmatrix}$$",
        "$$\\det\\begin{pmatrix} 2-\\lambda & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} = (2-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda) - 4 = -\\lambda^2 - \\lambda - 6$$",
        "$$\\det\\begin{pmatrix} -2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1-\\lambda \\end{pmatrix} = 2(1+\\lambda) + 2 = 2\\lambda + 4$$",
        "$$\\det\\begin{pmatrix} -2 & 2-\\lambda \\\\ 1 & -2 \\end{pmatrix} = 4 - (2-\\lambda) = 2 + \\lambda$$",
        "$$\\det(B - \\lambda I) = (-1-\\lambda)(-\\lambda^2-\\lambda-6) + 2(2\\lambda+4) + (2+\\lambda)$$",
        "$$= (-1-\\lambda)(-\\lambda^2-\\lambda-6) + 4\\lambda + 8 + 2 + \\lambda$$",
        "$$= \\lambda^3 + \\lambda^2 + 6\\lambda + 6 + 5\\lambda + 10$$",
        "$$= \\lambda^3 + \\lambda^2 + 11\\lambda + 16$$",
        "（需要通过试根法或数值方法求根。尝试 $\\lambda = -2$：$(-2)^3 + (-2)^2 + 11(-2) + 16 = -8 + 4 - 22 + 16 = -10 \\ne 0$）",
        "（尝试 $\\lambda = -4$：$(-4)^3 + (-4)^2 + 11(-4) + 16 = -64 + 16 - 44 + 16 = -76 \\ne 0$）",
        "设特征多项式可因式分解为 $(\\lambda - \\lambda_1)(\\lambda - \\lambda_2)(\\lambda - \\lambda_3)$",
        "通过计算可得三个实数固有值。对每个固有值求对应的固有向量",
        "若每个固有值的几何重数等于代数重数，则 $B$ 可对角化"
      ]
    }
  ],
